@startuml
title Order pricing — user goal
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Shopper" as ACT_Shopper
rectangle "Order Pricing" {
  usecase "CU-01\nQuote cart" as CU_01
}
ACT_Shopper -- CU_01

note bottom of CU_01
  Input: Product codes, quantities, CNY,
  optional Coupon code, explicit evaluation instant.
  Output: PriceQuote or a clear refusal.
  Trusted server-side catalog is inside this demo boundary.
end note
@enduml
